<view class="page"><text class="eyebrow">{{date}}</text><view class="title">今天</view><view class="hero"><view class="hero-label">留一点从容，给今天。</view><view class="hero-detail">课程与成绩，随手可查。</view><view class="hero-action" bindtap="schedule">查看本周课表 →</view></view><view class="row section"><text class="heading">今日课程</text><text class="link" bindtap="schedule">全部课表 ›</text></view><view wx:if="{{!courses.length}}" class="card empty">{{emptyMessage}}<view wx:if="{{!hasToday}}" class="link" bindtap="schedule">前往同步</view></view><view wx:if="{{hasCache}}" class="small cache-hint">{{cacheHint}}<view>最近同步 {{updated}}，调课信息以最近同步结果为准</view></view><view class="card row" wx:for="{{courses}}" wx:key="id"><view class="time">{{item.start > 0 ? item.start + '–' + item.end : '待定'}}<view class="small">节</view></view><view class="course"><view class="heading">{{item.name}}</view><view class="course-time">{{item.time}}</view><view class="small">{{item.place}}</view></view></view><view class="card row" bindtap="grades"><view><view class="heading">我的成绩</view><view class="small">按学期查看已发布成绩</view></view><text class="link">查询 ›</text></view><view class="small">非官方校园工具 · 数据以学校系统为准</view></view>